    "image": "place.jpg",
    "intro": {
      "en": "Bramble Hollow is made up, so we picked a real place where crested porcupines, badgers, red squirrels and moles all live: the Casentino Forests National Park in Italy. It's one of the few places in Europe where you can meet a porcupine!"
    },
